  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "Casting Thruster grants x6 <arc/>Bolt Charge. Casting your Barricade grants x4 <arc/>Bolt Charge to you and nearby allies.\n\nWhile within your Barricade's area of effect, you and allies gain x1 stack of <arc/>Bolt Charge every 0.6 seconds, and can discharge <arc/>Bolt Charge through weapon damage.\n\n<arc/>Spark of Frequency does not increase the rate at which the barricade grants <arc/>Bolt Charge. \n\nMultiple <arc/>Storm's Keep Barricades do not stack.",
      "updatedAt": "2026-05-22T21:39:40.951Z",
      "updatedBy": "Hawkmoona"
    }
  },
